<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian Coffee Temperature and Rain.</title>
<headline>Brazilian Coffee Temperature and Rain.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Coffee Region Temperatures (Centigrade) and Rain (Millimeters) in the Last 24 Hours to 1200 GMT Today.</p>
<p>Parana State: Londrina 21.2, Nil, maringa 22.2, 11.0 mm, Umuarama 22.6, 2.8 mm, Paranavai 22.9, Nil.</p>
<p>Sao Paulo State: Presidente Prudente 22.8, Nil, Franca 19.3, Nil, Votuporanga 22.3, Nil, Catanduva 21.8, Nil, Sao Carlos 18.5, Nil, Simao 20.8, 0.3 mm.</p>
<p>Minas Gerais State: Pocos de Caldas 16.0, 6.0 mm, Guaxupe 18.4, 4.0 mm.</p>
</text>
